  "details": "I made it so when my tail gets pulled past a specific point it plays a noise and tries to stop the other user from holding my tail any longer by toggling off grabbing and posing to make it seem like it slipped out of their hands. Disabling those when the 2nd user still is holding my tail results in the 2nd user still being able to hold the tail until they let go not forcing it out of their hands.\nI am not sure if this is intended or not but it would be useful to be able to force an object out of someones hands once those are toggled off.",
